         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               AberrationSpotterTG 2.2.0 introduces a refreshed interface. Open the script first, then select or load an image and apply your settings. Saved process instances now apply directly to target images. Includes panel-size validation, corrected corner boundaries, and updated documentation with a new screenshot.
